&gt;&gt; Jesse: WE HAVE BEEN HEARING

00:00:45.569 --> 00:00:49.539
ABOUT THIS.

00:00:46.703 --> 00:00:50.273
THIS WAS AN OBAMA HOLDOVER,

00:00:49.673 --> 00:00:52.142
SHULKIN.

00:00:50.407 --> 00:00:53.043
WE KNOW WHAT HAPPENED AT THE VA

00:00:52.275 --> 00:00:54.110
