00:01:04.955 --> 00:01:07.691
CLEANED THINGS UP.

00:01:05.822 --> 00:01:08.892
I DON'T KNOW HOW EFFECTIVE HE

00:01:07.824 --> 00:01:09.926
WASN'T DOING THAT.

00:01:09.025 --> 00:01:11.027
THE PRESIDENT CAMPAIGNED ON

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:15.899
TAKING CARE OF VETERANS AND HE

00:01:11.161 --> 00:01:16.433
WAS VERY PROUD TO SIGN A NEW VA

00:01:16.032 --> 00:01:17.667
ACCOUNTABILITY BILL.

00:01:16.566 --> 00:01:20.871
IT WAS EASIER TO FIRE PEOPLE WHO

00:01:17.801 --> 00:01:22.172
WERE UNDERPERFORMING.

00:01:21.004 --> 00:01:22.839
THERE WERE TRAVEL ISSUES WITH

00:01:22.305 --> 00:01:24.841
HIM.

00:01:22.973 --> 00:01:26.076
HE MIGHT HAVE RUN AFOUL OF THE

00:01:24.975 --> 00:01:27.677
ADMINISTRATION ON SOME ETHICAL

00:01:26.209 --> 00:01:29.079
ISSUES WITH RESPECT TO THAT.

00:01:27.811 --> 00:01:30.247
HE HAD TO GO.

00:01:29.212 --> 00:01:32.682
THE PRESIDENT IS NOT GOING TO

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:35.852
KEEP SOME GUY AT THAT AGENCY

00:01:32.816 --> 00:01:36.920
THAT'S NOT 100% BEHIND THE

00:01:35.986 --> 00:01:39.055
VETERANS AND CAN'T AFFORD TO

00:01:37.053 --> 00:01:39.923
ALLOW ANY SORT OF PERCEPTION OUT

00:01:39.189 --> 00:01:43.260
THERE THAT THE PRESIDENT IS NOT

00:01:40.056 --> 00:01:44.194
TAKING CARE OF THE VETS THAT HE

00:01:43.393 --> 00:01:51.534
SO DEEPLY VALUES.

